<rml>
<head>
	<title>Options (Phase 3 wireframe)</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../../components.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="phase3.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- M2 wireframe of the native options screen, gameplay page (docs/ui/options.md). Literal data. -->
<body class="p3">
<div class="p3-root">
	<div class="p3-bg"></div>
	<div class="p3-head">
		<div class="p3-heading"><span class="p3-kicker">In game &#183; Day 12, 14:35 &#183; B13: Drassen</span><span class="p3-title" id="options.title">Options</span></div>
		<div class="p3-actions">
			<button class="btn" id="options.save"><img class="icon" src="icon-save"/><span class="label">Save Game</span><span class="kbd">S</span></button>
			<button class="btn" id="options.load"><img class="icon" src="icon-load"/><span class="label">Load Game</span><span class="kbd">L</span></button>
			<button class="btn btn-ghost" id="options.quit"><img class="icon" src="icon-exit-sector"/><span class="label">Quit to main menu</span></button>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="p3-main">
		<div class="op-nav"><div class="op-tab active" id="options.tab.gameplay"><img class="icon" src="icon-target"/><span>Gameplay</span><span class="kbd">1</span></div><div class="op-tab" id="options.tab.video"><img class="icon" src="icon-look"/><span>Video</span><span class="kbd">2</span></div><div class="op-tab" id="options.tab.audio"><img class="icon" src="icon-talk"/><span>Audio</span><span class="kbd">3</span></div><div class="op-tab" id="options.tab.controls"><img class="icon" src="icon-pointer"/><span>Controls</span><span class="kbd">4</span></div><div class="op-tab" id="options.tab.access"><img class="icon" src="icon-info"/><span>Accessibility</span><span class="kbd">5</span></div></div>
		<div class="op-content"><div class="op-cols"><div class="op-col"><div class="op-group"><span class="section">Combat</span><div class="op-row" id="options.toggle.show_misses"><span class="name">Show Misses</span><div class="toggle on"><span class="switch"><span class="knob"></span></span></div></div><div class="op-row" id="options.toggle.hide_bullets"><span class="name">Hide Bullets</span><div class="toggle"><span class="switch"><span class="knob"></span></span></div></div><div class="op-row is-hover" id="options.toggle.tracking_mode"><span class="name">Tracking Mode</span><div class="toggle on"><span class="switch"><span class="knob"></span></span></div></div><div class="op-row" id="options.toggle.rtconfirm"><span class="name">Real Time Confirmation</span><div class="toggle"><span class="switch"><span class="knob"></span></span></div></div><div class="op-row" id="options.toggle.movement_path"><span class="name">Show Movement Path</span><span class="kbd">Shift</span><div class="toggle"><span class="switch"><span class="knob"></span></span></div></div></div></div><div class="op-col"><div class="op-group"><span class="section">Campaign</span><div class="op-row" id="options.toggle.sleepwake"><span class="name">Display sleep/wake notifications</span><div class="toggle on"><span class="switch"><span class="knob"></span></span></div></div><div class="op-row" id="options.toggle.metric"><span class="name">Use Metric System</span><div class="toggle"><span class="switch"><span class="knob"></span></span></div></div><div class="op-row" id="options.toggle.blood"><span class="name">Blood n Gore</span><div class="toggle on"><span class="switch"><span class="knob"></span></span></div></div></div><div class="op-group"><span class="section">This campaign (set at new game)</span><div class="panel pad"><div class="kv"><span class="k">Difficulty</span><span class="v">Experienced</span></div><div class="kv"><span class="k">Game style</span><span class="v">Realistic</span></div><div class="kv"><span class="k">Guns</span><span class="v">Tons of Guns</span></div><div class="kv"><span class="k">Saving</span><span class="v">Iron Man</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="op-help"><div class="panel"><span class="h">Tracking Mode</span><span class="p">When ON, the camera will keep focus on the selected merc while in combat mode.</span><div class="m"><span>Hover or focus a setting to read about it here</span></div></div></div></div>
	</div>
	<div class="p3-foot">
		<div class="p3-hints"><span class="kbd">1</span><span class="kbd">5</span><span class="h">page</span><span class="kbd">Tab</span><span class="h">next setting</span><span class="kbd">Space</span><span class="h">change</span><span class="h dim">Changes apply at once and are saved</span></div>
		<button class="btn btn-primary" id="options.done"><img class="icon" src="icon-confirm"/><span class="label">Done</span><span class="kbd">Esc</span></button>
	</div>
</div>
</body>
</rml>
